+        f"Edge ids are the integers 0 through {inst['edge_count'] - 1}.",
+        "Allowed color labels: " + ", ".join(map(str, inst["palette"])),
+        "",
+        "Each line `u--v : e1 e2 e3 e4` is one four-edge parallel bundle between distinct base vertices u and v:",
